<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Motors March output up 9.9% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Motors March output up 9.9% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Monday that its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas production in March were, with percentage changes from a year earlier, as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  131,697   up    9.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		90,177   up   12.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     41,520   up    3.9 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    127,080   up    8.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		64,971   up   24.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     62,109   down  3.5 percent</p>
<p> Exports		50,982   up    3.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		36,135   up   15.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     14,847   down 18.0 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    69,496   up   22.8 percent</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors' domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas production in the year to March 1997 were, with percentage changes from a year earlier as follows:</p>
<p> Production	 1,221,171  down  4.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		797,231  down  8.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     423,940  up    3.4 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     771,950  down  5.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		384,264  down 10.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     387,686  up    0.7 percent</p>
<p> Exports		462,077  down  5.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		318,894  down  1.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     143,183  down 11.8 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    762,612  up   13.7 percent</p>
</text>
